*** Keywords ***
Start LTE Downlink Test
    [Documentation]
    ...  Starts LTE Downlink Test via admin API. Version for TDD and FDD.

    [Arguments]  ${distname_realtime}
    ...          ${test_model}
    ...          ${earfcn_dl}
    ...          ${phy_cell_id}
    ...          ${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...          ${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...          ${connection}
    ...          ${timeout}=60

    Robot log operation                                     Starting LTE DL ${test_model} test model...
    ${start_test_result}                                    tm_lte_adm.start_lte_downlink_test
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${distname_realtime}
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model}
    ...                                                     earfcn=${earfcn_dl}
    ...                                                     phy_cell_id=${phy_cell_id}
    ...                                                     tdd_spec_subf_conf=${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...                                                     tdd_frame_conf=${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Should Be Equal As Strings                              ${start_test_result['status']}
    ...                                                     Succeeded
    ...                                                     msg=LTE DL ${test_model} test model start failed: ${start_test_result['msg']}
    Robot Log Step                                          LTE DL ${test_model} test model has started successfully.


